SUMMARY:Ballet Class
DESCRIPTION:The ballet class will be fun and creative\, whilst still encour
 aging correct technique and learning the basics of Ballet. Imagery and sto
 ry play are key parts of the process. The children will learn to express t
 hemselves through movement\, whilst gaining flexibility and fantastic post
 ure\n\nPlease wear comfortable clothing. If you have tutus and leotards fa
 ntastic. Not to worry if not.\n\nSuggested donation £2. For more informat
 ion get in touch with lilykourakou@hotmail.com.
