 -2026-10-29-2026-11-26/
SUMMARY:A Day of Discovery
DESCRIPTION:A Day of Discovery\n\nJoin the specialists from Sworders Fine A
 rt Auctioneers for a complimentary valuation day at Primrose Hill Communit
 y Library the last Thursday of every month. Whether you’re considering s
 elling or are simply curious\, bring along your items to receive expert au
 ction advice\, learn more about your treasured pieces and explore their po
 tential in today’s market.\n\nThe specialists can assist with valuations
  in the following areas: Art\, Antiques\, Jewellery\, Watches\, Design (sp
 an a wide range of movements from the mid-nineteenth century to the presen
 t day)\, Collectables\, Books\, Maps\, Asian and Indian works of art\, coi
 ns\, medals and silver\n\nSpecialists will be on hand to conduct valuation
 s from:\n\n10am - 3pm\n\nFor advance enquiries\, please contact london@swo
 rder.co.uk or call 020 3971 2500.\n\nHome valuation visits are also availa
 ble upon request.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.phcl.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/
 Valuation.png
