URL:https://www.phcl.org/events/first-class-learning-maths-and-english-lea
 rning-centre-6-2026-01-15-2026-01-22-2026-01-29-2026-02-05-2026-02-12-2026
 -02-19-2026-02-26-2026-03-05-2026-03-12-2026-03-19-2026-03-26-2026-04-19-2
 026-11-26/
SUMMARY:First Class Learning Maths and English Learning Centre
DESCRIPTION:First Class Learning is a worksheet based programme in line wit
 h the National Curriculum\, helping to boost confidence\, fill gaps\, ensu
 ring fluency and long term retention with independence. We have been worki
 ng with children from the age of 4 to 16 with both maths and English tuiti
 on. We cater for learners from Early Years and primary through to GCSE an
 d adult students. Our tuition centre incorporates First Class Learning\, S
 ATS\, 11+\, 13+ and GCSE worksheets.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nOur programme is based 
 on:\n\n 	10-15 minutes of daily homework with step-by-step approach\n 	Tel
 ephone support Monday to Friday\, 10am to 6pm\, if needed\n 	Aligned to th
 e National Curriculum\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nWe believe in 1% steps to 100% success
  and we are here to help your child achieve that! We are operational every
  Thursday\, from 3.45 pm to 6.00 pm at\n\nPrimrose Hill Community Library\
 n\nSharpleshall Street\n\nNW1 8YN\n\nLondon\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nCall us now on 
 +44 7966484568 and book your child for a FREE assessment!
CATEGORIES:Learning
LOCATION:Primrose Hill Community Library\, Primrose Hill Community Library\
 , 11-16 Sharples Hall St\, Primrose Hill\, London\, Greater London\, NW1 8
 YN\, United Kingdom
