URL:https://www.phcl.org/events/film-show-mamma-mia/
SUMMARY:Film Show: Mamma Mia
DESCRIPTION:Doors: 7.15pm • Introduction: 7.45pm • Film: 8.00pm\n\n2008
  • Musical/Comedy • 1h 48m • 12\n\nDirected by: Phyllida Lloyd\n\nS
 tarring: Meryl Streep\, Amanda Seyfried\, Pierce Brosnan &amp\; Colin Firt
 h\n\nGet ready for sunshine\, romance and an irresistible collection of AB
 BA classics with Mamma Mia!\, the hugely popular musical comedy directed b
 y Phyllida Lloyd. Set against the stunning backdrop of a Greek island\, th
 is feel-good film is bursting with infectious energy\, laugh-out-loud mome
 nts and much-loved songs that will have you singing along.\n\nThe story ce
 ntres on Sophie Sheridan\, played by Amanda Seyfried\, a young woman prepa
 ring for her wedding who has one big wish: to discover the identity of her
  father before she walks down the aisle. Without telling her mother\, Donn
 a\, a spirited former singer played by Meryl Streep\, Sophie secretly invi
 tes three men from Donna's past to the island. Enter Sam (Pierce Brosnan)\
 , Bill (Stellan Skarsgård) and Harry (Colin Firth)\, whose unexpected arr
 ival sets in motion a wonderfully chaotic series of revelations\, romantic
  entanglements and family surprises.\n\nWith a fantastic supporting cast i
 ncluding Julie Walters and Christine Baranski as Donna's lifelong friends\
 , and a soundtrack packed with ABBA favourites such as Dancing Queen\, The
  Winner Takes It All and Gimme! Gimme! Gimme!\, the film is a joyous celeb
 ration of friendship\, family and second chances.\n\nAn irresistible slice
  of escapism\, Mamma Mia! is the perfect big-screen treat\, guaranteed to 
 lift your spirits and leave you humming all the way home.\n\n\n\nTickets\n
 [tt-event url='https://www.tickettailor.com/checkout/new-session/id/939678
 2/chk/20a4a35a9d8e248ad11997bb2bcf75c9/?ref=website_widget&amp\;show_event
 _filter=false' minimal='true' bg_fill='false' show_logo='false' inherit_re
 f_from_url_param='' ref='website_widget']\n\nThe Film Show often sells out
 \, so please book early.\n\nIf you’re unable to buy tickets online\, you
  can purchase them in advance at the Library. Will or Cheuk will be happy 
 to help.\n\nA very limited number of tickets will be available at the Libr
 ary on the night\, first come first served\, but availability is not guara
 nteed.\n\nPlease note: tickets are non-refundable\, seating is unreserved\
 , and latecomers may not be admitted\; their seats may be given to another
  guest.\n\n\n\nMap\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.phcl.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/
 mamma-mia-before-after-071123-tout-fe96a39e80fe4af88ac4ecf2a0ff6ab7.jpg
CATEGORIES:Film Show
LOCATION:https://goo.gl/maps/vdiRTuBHU8PBzVLy8
END:VEVENT
