SUMMARY:Interactive & Fun Storytelling
DESCRIPTION:With over 30 years of experience\, Tales with Tracey offers a f
 un and educational experience for your little ones. Each session features 
 a well-loved children's book\, enhanced with props\, expressive character 
 voices\, and interactive storytelling.\n\nAlongside the story\, children w
 ill enjoy singing\, rhymes\, and lively verbal exchanges that encourage th
 em to learn new words\, improve language skills\, and boost their imaginat
 ion.\n\n£3\n\n10.30am on Fridays | 11am on Saturdays.
